text.section:
The Board shall make, adopt and promulgate regulations governing the following aspects of private management and operation of juvenile correctional facilities:

Contingency plans for state operation of a contractor-operated facility in the event of a termination of the contract;


Use of physical force and mechanical restraint by the contractors' security personnel;


Methods of monitoring a contractor-operated facility by the Department or the Board;


Public access to a contractor-operated facility; and


Such other regulations as may be necessary to carry out the provisions of this chapter.
